[{"client_msg_id":"e5e4a94a-5afd-44be-bb02-056abb1a32ee","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーん、WSL から Win 側の lemonade に繋げない問題、そもそも lemonade を使うのは ssh の時だけなので WSL の外から ssh すればいいのでは、ってなってこの目論見は成功したのだけど、別の罠が…","ts":"1622124039.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T97D7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85bbe508-2a04-4eb9-8ab9-0b134985bd54","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"WSL 上から ssh.exe で繋いだところキーが送られなかったので、Win32 版 ssh に問題がありそうですね…","ts":"1622123972.080400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8JhQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"393b793d-5132-4689-9da4-10827efcdaf9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど…","ts":"1622123902.079700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/E4nV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed02598b-d5a2-4627-9c14-ef0ea2697517","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これは `\u0026lt;S-Tab\u0026gt;`  が特殊な挙動をしてるのに起因してるらしいので違うかな","ts":"1622123342.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"73b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce390056-d668-4ac8-8253-da4cc30e46b8","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/slacklog/CJMV3MSLR/2021/04/#ts-1617850798.028700\u003e\nこれと同じ問題かは分からないですが","ts":"1622123077.078600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gsL2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f3d949c-6488-4dab-8f3b-a158e67f84d2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Windows Terminalだったかssh.exeだったかの問題で特定のキーコードがssh先に送られない\n解決策としてTeraTermやPuTTYを使うのが挙げられてたはずです","ts":"1622122940.078100","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1622122952.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vxnx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0864e1e0-df5a-4bf3-819b-c1b699af3f9d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"その問題、ちょっと前にここでやってた記憶","ts":"1622122874.077100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qkf7g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"700d5199-4556-4f25-b572-e759082d0d72","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"Linux版sshとWin32版sshの違い？","ts":"1622121112.076200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A92"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3f77bd3-4a7f-4197-b06b-da80f051bfeb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Windows Terminal で、WSL から ssh した Linux 環境上の Vim だと `\u0026lt;C-Space\u0026gt;` で何かしらのキー入力が入るのだけど、cmd.exe や PowerShell から全く同じホストに ssh して全く同じ Vim で `\u0026lt;C-Space\u0026gt;` を入力しても何も反応がない","ts":"1622120015.076100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ns/Sz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e5ba025-56f2-4162-9fe0-630c3e3f3d3c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ｵｯ","ts":"1622106097.074100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qNiaf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0c81621-5d50-4705-89ae-b33a431617a8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://news.mynavi.jp/article/20210527-1894790/\u003e","ts":"1622106088.073700","attachments":[{"fallback":"TECH+: 日本語環境でも利用可能になった「Windows Package Manager 1.0」がリリース","id":1,"title":"日本語環境でも利用可能になった「Windows Package Manager 1.0」がリリース","title_link":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20210527-1894790/","text":"Microsoftは米国時間2021年5月26日、「[Windows Package Manager」のバージョン1.0をリリースしたことを明らかにした。","image_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20210527-1894790/index_images/index.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1622055649,"service_name":"TECH+","service_icon":"https://news.mynavi.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20210527-1894790/